{"id":20,"title":"算术运算符","summary":" 在本课中，我们将学习如何使用算术运算符进行计算。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8e924f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","text":"\n下面表格中，我们按运算**优先级**列举了基本算术运算符。在前面的运算符将被优先计算，如乘、除大于加、减。\n\n这些运算符允许我们在Python中直接进行算术运算。\n\n| **运算符**| **用途** | **注释** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `()`| 括号 | 标记整体计算的部分 |\n| `**`| 指数 | In-fix双值运算 |\n| `%`, `*`, `/`, `//`  | 取模、乘法、除法、地板除法 | In-fix双值运算  |\n| `+`, `-` | 加法、减法| In-fix双值运算 |\n\n## 加法\n\n我们可以用`+`运算符将两个数字相加。","text_html":"<p>下面表格中，我们按运算<strong>优先级</strong>列举了基本算术运算符。在前面的运算符将被优先计算，如乘、除大于加、减。</p>\n<p>这些运算符允许我们在Python中直接进行算术运算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>运算符</strong></th>\n<th><strong>用途</strong></th>\n<th><strong>注释</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>()</code></td>\n<td>括号</td>\n<td>标记整体计算的部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>**</code></td>\n<td>指数</td>\n<td>In-fix双值运算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>%</code>, <code>*</code>, <code>/</code>, <code>//</code></td>\n<td>取模、乘法、除法、地板除法</td>\n<td>In-fix双值运算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>+</code>, <code>-</code></td>\n<td>加法、减法</td>\n<td>In-fix双值运算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>加法</h2>\n<p>我们可以用<code>+</code>运算符将两个数字相加。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8ea96f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"print(10 + 5)\n\nfloat1 = 13.65\nfloat2 = 3.40\nprint(float1 + float2)\n\nnum = 20\nflt = 10.5\nprint(num + flt)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8eb04f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","text":"正如我们在**第9行**看到的，将一个整数`num`和浮点数`flt`相加，可以得到一个浮点数。Python会自动将整数转换为浮点数。这适用于所有的算术运算。\n\n## 减法\n\n我们可以用`-`运算符将一个数字减去另一个。","text_html":"<p>正如我们在<strong>第9行</strong>看到的，将一个整数<code>num</code>和浮点数<code>flt</code>相加，可以得到一个浮点数。Python会自动将整数转换为浮点数。这适用于所有的算术运算。</p>\n<h2>减法</h2>\n<p>我们可以用<code>-</code>运算符将一个数字减去另一个。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8eb4af85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"print(10 - 5)\n\nfloat1 = -18.678\nfloat2 = 3.55\nprint(float1 - float2)\n\nnum = 20\nflt = 10.5\nprint(num - flt)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8eb86f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 乘法\n\n我们可以使用`*`运算符将两个数字相乘。","text_html":"<h2>乘法</h2>\n<p>我们可以使用<code>*</code>运算符将两个数字相乘。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8ebc2f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"print(40 * 10)\n\nfloat1 = 5.5\nfloat2 = 4.5\nprint(float1 * float2)\n\nprint(10.2 * 3)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8ebf4f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 除法\n\n我们可以用`/`运算符将一个数字除以另一个数字。","text_html":"<h2>除法</h2>\n<p>我们可以用<code>/</code>运算符将一个数字除以另一个数字。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":6},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8ec30f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"print(40 / 10)\n\nfloat1 = 5.5\nfloat2 = 4.5\nprint(float1 / float2)\nprint(12.4 / 2)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8ec6cf85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","text":"除法操作的结果总是一个**浮点数**，即便参与运算的数都是整数。\n\n### 地板除法\n\n在地板除法中，**结果是最接近的小整数**(非四舍五入)。它也被称为**整数除法**。\n\n对于地板除法，我们必须使用`//`运算符。","text_html":"<p>除法操作的结果总是一个<strong>浮点数</strong>，即便参与运算的数都是整数。</p>\n<h3>地板除法</h3>\n<p>在地板除法中，<strong>结果是最接近的小整数</strong>(非四舍五入)。它也被称为<strong>整数除法</strong>。</p>\n<p>对于地板除法，我们必须使用<code>//</code>运算符。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":8},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8ec9ef85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"print(43 // 10)  # 结果为4，整数\nprint(47 // 10)  # 结果为4，整数\n\nfloat1 = 5.5\nfloat2 = 4.5\nprint(5.5 // 4.5) # 结果为 1.0, 浮点数\nprint(12.4 // 2)  # 结果为 6.0, 浮点数\nprint(9.8 // 9)  # 结果为1.0，浮点数","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":9},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8ecdaf85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","text":"与普通除法不同，两个整数之间的地板除法结果是一个整数，但如果其中一个数为浮点数，则结果为浮点数。\n\n## 取模\n\n一个数字除以另一个数字的[余数](https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A8%A1%E9%99%A4)可以用`%`操作符获取。","text_html":"<p>与普通除法不同，两个整数之间的地板除法结果是一个整数，但如果其中一个数为浮点数，则结果为浮点数。</p>\n<h2>取模</h2>\n<p>一个数字除以另一个数字的<a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A8%A1%E9%99%A4\">余数</a>可以用<code>%</code>操作符获取。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":10},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8ed0cf85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"print(10 % 2)\n\ntwenty_eight = 28\nprint(twenty_eight % 10)\n\nprint(-28 % 10)   # 如果右边的操作数是正数，余数就是正数。\nprint(28 % -10)   # 如果右边的操作数是负数，余数就是负数\nprint(34.4 % 2.5) # 余数可以是一个浮点数\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":11},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8ed48f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 优先级\n\n包含不同运算符的算术表达式将根据**运算符的优先级**来计算。\n\n只要运算符的优先级相同，表达式就会从左边开始计算。","text_html":"<h2>优先级</h2>\n<p>包含不同运算符的算术表达式将根据<strong>运算符的优先级</strong>来计算。</p>\n<p>只要运算符的优先级相同，表达式就会从左边开始计算。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":12},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8ed84f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"# 不同的优先级\nprint(10 - 3 * 2) # 先计算乘法，后计算减法\n\n# 优先级相同\nprint(3 * 20 / 5) # 先计算乘法，后计算除法\nprint(3 / 20 * 5) # 先计算除法，然后再计算乘法","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":13},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8edb6f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 括号\n\n包含在括号`()`内的表达式将被首先计算，与运算符的优先级无关。","text_html":"<h2>括号</h2>\n<p>包含在括号<code>()</code>内的表达式将被首先计算，与运算符的优先级无关。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":14},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8edf2f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"print((10 - 3) * 2) # 减法首先发生\nprint((18 + 2) / (10 % 8))","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":15},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7a8ee24f85011ebaef43af9d3c2d1d5","text":"使用上面的所有算术运算符，可以在Python中计算复杂的数学任务。\n\n请记住，在Python中从不局限于这些运算符。还有无数的算术工具供我们使用，其中一些很快就会被讨论。\n\n---\n\n下一课将介绍**比较运算符**。","text_html":"<p>使用上面的所有算术运算符，可以在Python中计算复杂的数学任务。</p>\n<p>请记住，在Python中从不局限于这些运算符。还有无数的算术工具供我们使用，其中一些很快就会被讨论。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>下一课将介绍<strong>比较运算符</strong>。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":16}],"status":"undo","course_no":"002","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/002/page/20"}
